<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Anchor Bancorp raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Anchor Bancorp raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--ABN AMRO Chicago Corp said Wednesday it raised Anchor Bancorp of Wisconsin Inc to a buy from a hold.</p>
<p>--Anchor Bancorp's fiscal 1997 earnings estimate was raised to $3.72 from $3.45 and its fiscal 1998 estimate was raised to $4.05 from $3.50, Chicago Corp said.</p>
<p>--The rating upgrade is on a fundamental basis due to improved earnings outlook, Chicago Corp said, noting that stock benefit plan expenses are expected to decline in the near term, while non-interest income from partnership investments are reportedly sustainable.</p>
<p>--The stock was up 1/8 at 39-1/2 Wednesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
